</h4>
    <p id="para-00013">When Desmos is used, there is a tab at the bottom of the screen that opens the keyboard for Desmos. The keyboard is shown below. On the keyboard (<a href="3-4-rational-numbers#fig-00004" class="autogenerated-content" aria-label="View Figure 3.24">Figure 3.24</a>) is the square root symbol <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>. To find the square root of a number, click the square root key, and then type the number. Desmos will automatically display the value of the square root as you enter the number.</p>
