    <div data-type="note" class="tech-check ui-has-child-title" id="note-00006"><header><h3 class="os-title" data-type="title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Tech Check</span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="os-note-body"><h4 data-type="title" class="os-subtitle">
  <span class="os-subtitle-label">Using Desmos to Find Lowest Terms</span>
</h4>
    <p id="para-00039">Desmos is a free <a href="https://openstax.org/r/calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Go to online calculator">online calculator</a>. Desmos supports reducing fractions to lowest terms. When a fraction is entered, Desmos immediately calculates the decimal representation of the fraction. However, to the left of the fraction, there is a button that, when clicked, shows the fraction in reduced form.</p>
    </div></section></div>
    <div data-type="note" class="video ui-has-child-title" id="note-00047"><header><h3 class="os-title" data-type="title">
