</h3></header><section>
<div class="body"><h4 data-type="title">Adding Rational Numbers Using Desmos</h4>
    <div data-type="exercise" id="exer-00009" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section>
    <div data-type="problem" id="prob-00009"><div class="os-problem-container">
    <p id="para-00044">Calculate <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> using Desmos.</p>
    </div></div>
    <details data-type="solution" id="sol-00005" aria-label="Show/Hide Solution">
        <summary class="btn-link ui-toggle" title="Show/Hide Solution" data-content="Show/Hide Solution"></summary>
        <section class="ui-body" role="alert"><h4 data-type="solution-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Solution</span>
</h4>
<div class="os-solution-container">
    <p id="para-00045">Enter <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> in Desmos. The result is displayed as <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.70833333333</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mn>0.70833333333</mn></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> (which is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.708</mn><mover accent="true"><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mn>0.708</mn><mover accent="true"><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>). Clicking the fraction button to the left on the calculation line yields <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfrac></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
      </details>
    </section></div>
    </div></section></div>
    <div data-type="note" class="your-turn ui-has-child-title" id="note-00008"><header><h3 class="os-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Your Turn </span>
