    <div data-type="note" class="video ui-has-child-title" id="note-00050"><header><h3 class="os-title" data-type="title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Video</span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="os-note-body">
    <p id="para-00131"><a href="https://openstax.org/r/Multiplying_Fractions" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Go to Multiplying Fractions">Multiplying Fractions</a></p>
    </div></section></div>
    <p id="para-00132">As with multiplication, division of rational numbers can be done using a calculator.</p>
    <div data-type="example" id="exam-00017" class="ui-has-child-title"><header><h3 class="os-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Example </span>
  <span class="os-number">3.67</span>
  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="body"><h4 data-type="title">Dividing Decimals with a Calculator</h4>
    <div data-type="exercise" id="exer-00033" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section>
    <div data-type="problem" id="prob-00033"><div class="os-problem-container">
    <p id="para-00133">Calculate 3.45 ÷
    2.341 using a calculator. Round to three decimal places if necessary.</p>
    </div></div>
    <details data-type="solution" id="sol-00017" aria-label="Show/Hide Solution">
        <summary class="btn-link ui-toggle" title="Show/Hide Solution" data-content="Show/Hide Solution"></summary>
        <section class="ui-body" role="alert"><h4 data-type="solution-title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Solution</span>
</h4>
<div class="os-solution-container">
    <p id="para-00134">Using a calculator, we obtain 1.473729175565997. Rounding to three decimal places we have 1.474.</p>
    </div>
</section>
