  <span class="os-title-label">Solution</span>
</h4>
<div class="os-solution-container">
    <p id="para-00179">To find a rational number between <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac>
    </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> and <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>:</p>
    <p id="para-00180"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Add the fractions.</p>
    <p id="para-00151">
