    <p id="para-00181"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Divide the result by 2. Recall that to divide by 2, you multiply by the reciprocal of 2. The reciprocal of 2 is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>, as seen below.</p>
    <p id="para-00289">
