</h3></header><section>
<div class="body"><h4 data-type="title">Finding a Percentage of a Total</h4>
    <div data-type="exercise" id="exer-00055" class="unnumbered"><header></header><section>
    <div data-type="problem" id="prob-00055"><div class="os-problem-container">
